			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Flins"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 765030101,
					"content": "#Oh ho? Dear {NICKNAME} and Paimon, is that you I spy? Bit of a remote locale for an encounter, I must say.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Flins"
				},
				{
					"id": 765030102,
					"content": "Hot on the trail of some lead, perhaps? Or might you happen to be lost?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030103,
						765030104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Flins"
				},
				{
					"id": 765030103,
					"content": "We're just looking around.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 765030105,
					"content": "Ah, I see. Indeed, the massive silhouette of the Kuuvahki Experimental Design Bureau has a... peculiar grandeur when viewed from the deck of this wrecked ship — like some slumbering colossus.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Flins"
				},
				{
					"id": 765030106,
					"content": "Yeah. It's super intimidating, even from way over here. Who knows how many secrets they've squirreled away in there...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 765030107,
					"content": "I imagine it could be a fine source of inspiration for you, considering your pursuit of unique material in that regard.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Flins"
				},
				{
					"id": 765030108,
					"content": "After all, the most fascinating tales are often born from the interstice between light and darkness.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Flins"
				},
				{
					"id": 765030109,
					"content": "Hehehe, with you standing here holding your trusty blue lantern, this place looks like a scene right out of a story already!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 765030110,
					"content": "Speaking of that, don't you have to man your post at... uh... that place? Are you on leave, or on patrol and stuff?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 765030111,
					"content": "Both, you could say. We Ratniki keep eternal watch for any calamity that might emerge from the shadows. As such, we must remain vigilant no matter where we are.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Flins"
				},
				{
					"id": 765030112,
					"content": "That said, things do appear stable around here, so no need to fret over-much. Go about your creative endeavor in peace.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030113,
						765030114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Flins"
				},
				{
					"id": 765030113,
					"content": "Well, since the opportunity's presenting itself...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 765030115,
					"content": "Of me? An unexpected request, if I may say so. I must confess that I am unused to standing in front of a Kamera — to being the watched rather than the watcher.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Flins"
				},
				{
					"id": 765030116,
					"content": "I suppose it comes of having silent graves and the whispers of the dead as common company. I'm sure you get where I'm coming from.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Flins"
				},
				{
					"id": 765030117,
					"content": "Still, t'would be uncouth to reject a friend's earnest entreaty. A travesty against the spirit of hospitality.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Flins"
				},
				{
					"id": 765030118,
					"content": "So, feel free to record that which you find most worthy of remembrance. It would be an honor and a pleasure to aid in inspiring you, if only a little.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Flins"
				},
				{
					"id": 765030114,
					"content": "Could we take a picture of you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030115
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 765030104,
					"content": "And looking for some photo-op material while we're at it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						765030105
					]
				}
			]
		},
